    "text": "Hints:\n$$\n\\begin{array}{ll}\n\\mathrm{C}_2(0,0) & r_1=4 \\\\\n\\mathrm{C}_2(0,1) & r_2=\\sqrt{0+1}=1\n\\end{array}\n$$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{C}_1 \\mathrm{C}_2=\\sqrt{0+1}=1 \\\\\n& r_1-r_2=3 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{C}_1 \\mathrm{C}_2 < r_1-r_2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
